{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-13621", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-13621", "text": "'Health Connect is too old to write to. Tap to update it'", "sha256": "557e64217cb7976834f80a969932dad51cb8739a274af30b43a96d3c4178cbe3", "kind": "dart", "start": 13621, "end": 13678, "line": 351}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-13759", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-13759", "text": "'This device has no health store to write to'", "sha256": "be24b30cbd12638fead76af623bc6127afb5f4248a413010603e8f7351c6be8a", "kind": "dart", "start": 13759, "end": 13804, "line": 353}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-14799", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-14799", "text": "'Contribution off'", "sha256": "245e279b2620b7715809f5663c5bb0cb9d38b4cb1238fe8a0410ee83ac5591d1", "kind": "dart", "start": 14799, "end": 14817, "line": 376}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-14943", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-14943", "text": "'Nothing was ever uploaded. Nothing will be.'", "sha256": "66c04303d0ef03ce0752850f1d003087d9114ab11dceae39f49d43ea41850fc2", "kind": "dart", "start": 14943, "end": 14988, "line": 380}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-15328", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-15328", "text": "'Nothing further will be uploaded.\\n\\n'\n'One copy of your database was uploaded on '\n'${last.toLocal().toString().split('", "sha256": "09a6b3a36b7d17afff27d302e7d2c8a8d1f862f92890e7ece52bb5ff97c7c8fb", "kind": "dart", "start": 15328, "end": 15493, "line": 386}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-15494", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-15494", "text": "').first}. The server '\n'keeps only the most recent copy per device. We tried to '\n'tell it your consent is withdrawn — that message is sent '\n'once and is not retried, so if this phone is offline it '\n'will not have arrived, and we cannot show you that the copy '\n'is gone either.'", "sha256": "d9e49edd27d942616b2b55d9c89f39b2f3ecc0d2cabbbd6cf95f1bf0b8a84454", "kind": "dart", "start": 15494, "end": 15886, "line": 388}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-16273", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-16273", "text": "'Contribute your health data?'", "sha256": "dc16424ca35ed0a78010981b09b3407800d7c712fcafbd38a50c6a7619fecc2d", "kind": "dart", "start": 16273, "end": 16303, "line": 409}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-16379", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-16379", "text": "'Once a day, on Wi-Fi and while charging, a compressed copy of your '\n'ENTIRE database is uploaded — every derived day and every raw sensor '\n'row the band has sent. It is used to improve the algorithms.\\n\\n'\n'It is not anonymous in any meaningful sense: it is your whole health '\n'history. You can switch this off at any time, and nothing further '\n'is sent from that moment.'", "sha256": "d84ea33611ec7316922698ca40c34151a5c352d0c699865bf3aa02cef923577b", "kind": "dart", "start": 16379, "end": 16836, "line": 412}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-17442", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-17442", "text": "'Delete everything?'", "sha256": "006d70aeb4c42a93f7924754a9aa38052d626b3d08ad833e1333a91acfb78d36", "kind": "dart", "start": 17442, "end": 17462, "line": 437}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-17971", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-17971", "text": "'This deletes, permanently and with no copy anywhere else:\\n\\n'\n'· every measured day, sleep, workout and route\\n'\n'· every lab result, meal, medication dose, habit, breathing session '\n'and logged set\\n'\n'· your journal, cycle log and rolling baselines\\n'\n'· your profile, every preference and any stored AI key\\n'\n'· the home-screen widget and every scheduled reminder\\n\\n'\n'The band is unpaired, and it cannot re-send history it has already '\n'handed over. Export from Your data first if you want a copy.'", "sha256": "dd3d72d7e8fdda3db54afae1b554480f0021a1d76063b599fe6a273e9f05872e", "kind": "dart", "start": 17971, "end": 18607, "line": 446}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-18764", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-18764", "text": "'Keep my data'", "sha256": "bd3db8052fd332c358a7bfa202251f3a5192156c7e47cd879452bfba9b30f133", "kind": "dart", "start": 18764, "end": 18778, "line": 459}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-18918", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-18918", "text": "'Delete everything'", "sha256": "54ccecb1b67e51bffcc51c288f83be5fa0ba74b66b530b8509dd78ec93319fce", "kind": "dart", "start": 18918, "end": 18937, "line": 462}
