{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-47236", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-47236", "text": "'Ask about efforts the band spotted that you did '\n'not start. Off hides the prompt and the '\n'review cards; the band goes on measuring '\n'either way'", "sha256": "19938d90dca3efa119c3a715285fa0676005e2a229928f9628dddaab3f0370d2", "kind": "dart", "start": 47236, "end": 47494, "line": 1085}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-47635", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-47635", "text": "'Movement nudge'", "sha256": "948bcaabaa6854c7cd7bcea05be9c179b982bbc4e6054db3fa0e0958e15711ef", "kind": "dart", "start": 47635, "end": 47651, "line": 1090}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-47681", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-47681", "text": "'Nudges you after a still stretch — two hours with '\n'no movement at all, or 90 minutes in a desk '\n'posture'", "sha256": "de1e21c7c5c84cdcf417384faa4e70b5815858ff98eb1c5bfc1c25632e08e8d6", "kind": "dart", "start": 47681, "end": 47854, "line": 1091}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-48024", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-48024", "text": "'Step goal alerts'", "sha256": "c7d60c648866fd465e116026e6ec5a1abec98550e213c2830a32f92a013a300f", "kind": "dart", "start": 48024, "end": 48042, "line": 1096}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-48139", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-48139", "text": "'Tells you once when today crosses your steps '\n'goal'", "sha256": "0fe3815ed07d26cb6c800a3ff50b870e9a029fcb85abac190028e57cbaba0bb1", "kind": "dart", "start": 48139, "end": 48229, "line": 1098}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-48538", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-48538", "text": "'Weekly lookback'", "sha256": "f6bced31f08de920855180c17288615a90a00de37712f5de5ade7f1e607e06b5", "kind": "dart", "start": 48538, "end": 48555, "line": 1106}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-48652", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-48652", "text": "'Sunday evening, but only for a week that '\n'actually found something. Most weeks are '\n'quiet'", "sha256": "6192d445154c4182ff33a51e67e57169c36fe7ecfb2c7d358fdc8ea0f2b4b09f", "kind": "dart", "start": 48652, "end": 48819, "line": 1108}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-49134", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-49134", "text": "'Medication reminders'", "sha256": "fadd9ab0b00100718bff278b1a4067fac5ffd0fee45419e44a0042998e6f058d", "kind": "dart", "start": 49134, "end": 49156, "line": 1115}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-49186", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-49186", "text": "'One alert per scheduled dose, at the times you '\n'entered. Nothing is sent for a dose already '\n'marked taken or skipped'", "sha256": "222531f60b30e224232c4b196cb862b1f0fdaef3c749b8c11be314f2f5e01610", "kind": "dart", "start": 49186, "end": 49372, "line": 1116}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-49512", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-49512", "text": "'Daily check-in'", "sha256": "232314a3e628594c23b852f9a4f97c5e2dbcb21dcfa759c88423208aee85ae76", "kind": "dart", "start": 49512, "end": 49528, "line": 1120}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-49623", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-49623", "text": "'One prompt in the evening to write the day — '\n'mood, energy, stress. Skipped once the day '\n'already has a rating in it'", "sha256": "7abfae27efdd009de00e97cd8715cc900070c71fc5de7dd0e74e2becf81622b8", "kind": "dart", "start": 49623, "end": 49817, "line": 1122}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-50103", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-50103", "text": "'Water reminder'", "sha256": "857710b92961d1907d01e674c3095f4e2779a8d54ea64063797f447fa1974e26", "kind": "dart", "start": 50103, "end": 50119, "line": 1128}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-50149", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-50149", "text": "'A reminder through your waking hours to log a '\n'drink. Nothing is measured either way'", "sha256": "b0eb02c6a3ae62e8ff51ea16dd8ab6d431f845eccc235997ed1f4d3a6ff0049c", "kind": "dart", "start": 50149, "end": 50269, "line": 1129}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-50480", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-50480", "text": "'Remind me every'", "sha256": "3ee46c5a7d708481c630916e903068b3059227e235f106cede19ccd0eb2836bf", "kind": "dart", "start": 50480, "end": 50497, "line": 1134}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-51123", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-51123", "text": "'A heads-up about 45 minutes before the bedtime '\n'learned from your own nights, kept clear of '\n'your quiet hours. Appears after about a '\n'week of wear'", "sha256": "51c7d1ab89eb704210a876e1b29e3ec432899570129119ae270279443603fdf3", "kind": "dart", "start": 51123, "end": 51385, "line": 1144}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-51592", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-51592", "text": "'Band alerts'", "sha256": "66eb2448bdabb6fec002a0e0b2c96d036b19163a2bb7b68018fb7dff76f22a07", "kind": "dart", "start": 51592, "end": 51605, "line": 1151}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-51690", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-51690", "text": "'Flat battery, on the charger, gone quiet'", "sha256": "8e4d7f1d54f1db9fc5efa63f34d19dbe26e22e3bf8c2d3aa9490ec22f5aa67fa", "kind": "dart", "start": 51690, "end": 51732, "line": 1153}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-51901", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-51901", "text": "'Alert me at'", "sha256": "cf41afe09ca8a9e4f460353eb1f059491570c94d6253723f6c54f82f0916d20c", "kind": "dart", "start": 51901, "end": 51914, "line": 1156}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-52007", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-52007", "text": "'Warn when the band drops under this charge '\n'level'", "sha256": "846131d013e2d8450773b04421f172af9c3eb436126bc28faa14d2b6141334a3", "kind": "dart", "start": 52007, "end": 52094, "line": 1158}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-52581", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-52581", "text": "'Android Relay'", "sha256": "bfa6e4024760e606fff667e55422858744cffc63018213d9f0d09415db35201a", "kind": "dart", "start": 52581, "end": 52596, "line": 1169}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-52808", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-52808", "text": "'Buzz on app notifications'", "sha256": "fee0a57f825dc2ff79046236fdc1f043a1e318059276289ea2da69aa20c0e836", "kind": "dart", "start": 52808, "end": 52835, "line": 1173}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-53074", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-53074", "text": "'Choose which apps, alarms and calls make '\n'the band buzz'", "sha256": "2d0144989a49641fd66b8697ae80c2e9ce8e8df407b7dfe3deed0b107b7d3304", "kind": "dart", "start": 53074, "end": 53171, "line": 1177}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-53346", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-53346", "text": "'Quiet hours'", "sha256": "fbb959095058f5ad6ff94f651170b207bfd0e4ef8b6df78c8d4ffbb944a3967b", "kind": "dart", "start": 53346, "end": 53359, "line": 1181}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-53475", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-53475", "text": "'Quiet hours'", "sha256": "fbb959095058f5ad6ff94f651170b207bfd0e4ef8b6df78c8d4ffbb944a3967b", "kind": "dart", "start": 53475, "end": 53488, "line": 1183}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-53578", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-53578", "text": "'Nothing buzzes inside this window'", "sha256": "4c7ef26de6a4a3abaa9fd654b8b16d9e16d87730abd64d17dd394d6a2473610a", "kind": "dart", "start": 53578, "end": 53613, "line": 1185}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-54905", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-54905", "text": "'Health exceptions break through'", "sha256": "0c13073532196fd37b0f2e1607dcf2c053279755cea272f43574121bc87aa13f", "kind": "dart", "start": 54905, "end": 54938, "line": 1208}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-55416", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-55416", "text": "'The alarm is not on this list'", "sha256": "da056a75dcfd5b9fb4650c72e7c7a2375ee4ec3f5d48d20b8a5c8bec0c5957c6", "kind": "dart", "start": 55416, "end": 55447, "line": 1219}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-55522", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-55522", "text": "'Cancel it on the Alarm screen instead.'", "sha256": "5d512a79d13001dfa6a4e671590cb6368d3814de2e4faf67a35185496e95d1a8", "kind": "dart", "start": 55522, "end": 55562, "line": 1221}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-58877", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-58877", "text": "'$storeName did not grant those fields. Nothing was read.'", "sha256": "31194dc106cfaafc7c55241a85f9298759ffd53c848c78ac8bb58175ce352298", "kind": "dart", "start": 58877, "end": 58935, "line": 1311}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-59201", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-59201", "text": "'Nothing came back. $storeName holds no height, weight, '\n'birthday or sex for you — type them in here instead.'", "sha256": "6a1850a49ba77c994c23fbe34413d2d1fddf575437adaadc9cb51c835db2765a", "kind": "dart", "start": 59201, "end": 59337, "line": 1321}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-59415", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-59415", "text": "'Nothing came back. $storeName holds no height, weight'\n' or sex for you — type them in here instead.'", "sha256": "2943626d42667ebefad430688925d2df1f201dcd11f20ce520d6a11838f29d5c", "kind": "dart", "start": 59415, "end": 59541, "line": 1324}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-60158", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-60158", "text": "')}. Your profile already says the '\n'same thing, so nothing changed.'", "sha256": "91d95555e00d76e5f53aa8c64072f85fd76874f7be7f23831af60373087100b1", "kind": "dart", "start": 60158, "end": 60248, "line": 1340}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-66368", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-66368", "text": "'Edit profile'", "sha256": "4dd54497205d3db9c4cfda9705742a91756bad2c687d47c44968e46781b23154", "kind": "dart", "start": 66368, "end": 66382, "line": 1525}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-67482", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-67482", "text": "'Prefer not to say'", "sha256": "6dbf1373cba2c7c455854ad1b64c2d51aaeef6ef226f5af3f1dcf7b6c3bd2f3d", "kind": "dart", "start": 67482, "end": 67501, "line": 1548}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-69078", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-69078", "text": "'These four change your numbers'", "sha256": "89a483f3c9b94f2107e48bc3f4c4160161b862a1f4de5a5de0c8b31ad23f68bb", "kind": "dart", "start": 69078, "end": 69110, "line": 1581}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-69181", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-69181", "text": "'They feed heart-rate zones, calorie estimates and training '\n'load. Clear one and only the metrics that need it stay '\n'unavailable.'", "sha256": "ac7bbd6e29fe8ed3f04c8044f4133e08d74d3b5b3cf02e45b94f8f44bd39eb53", "kind": "dart", "start": 69181, "end": 69367, "line": 1583}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-70139", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-70139", "text": "'Height, weight, birthday and sex, straight out of '\n'$storeName. Height and weight are taken every time; your '\n'age and sex only fill a gap, because neither drifts and a '\n'value already here was your choice.'", "sha256": "1055c61eafc4f4f6e7811af6ffb69b05d35412e6076b7881ce87ff843baba418", "kind": "dart", "start": 70139, "end": 70422, "line": 1609}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-70505", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-70505", "text": "'Height and weight, straight out of $storeName. It has no '\n'birthday and no sex to read — no app can — so set those '\n'two above yourself.'", "sha256": "5ad9417323ff19797d1b23d7595ad2ecfe14960ef3310a3dc1c72fc93475ad72", "kind": "dart", "start": 70505, "end": 70693, "line": 1614}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-71845", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-71845", "text": "'Not set'", "sha256": "0dcc1a27051bce0e9a4e718964acbff196e4c94e975d986c0cb1ab76301a2adf", "kind": "dart", "start": 71845, "end": 71854, "line": 1651}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-74619", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-74619", "text": "'When a sync finishes'", "sha256": "4eb026c8088af86f6a35c3047fe53c95fae316eb73d86cb9f4bdd21498ae2eba", "kind": "dart", "start": 74619, "end": 74641, "line": 1729}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-74988", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-74988", "text": "'The app broadcasts an intent your automation '\n'app can start a profile on. Filter on the '\n'action below; it carries how many records '\n'landed and when, at most one a minute.'", "sha256": "1348fbc4041cab4bbf350c3a54eb9decf44449353c0b50d584e2f23775bac001", "kind": "dart", "start": 74988, "end": 75286, "line": 1737}
